        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Circle (2015 film), 12 Angry Men (1957 film)\n- People: Reginald Rose, Sidney Lumet, Mercy Malick\n- Topics: inspiration, film production, jury deliberation, notable works\n\nFacts:\n- The 1957 film 12 Angry Men was written and co-produced by Reginald Rose and directed by Sidney Lumet.\n- The 1957 film 12 Angry Men tells the story of a jury of 12 men deliberating a defendant's guilt or acquittal based on reasonable doubt.\n- The 2015 film Circle was shot in 2014.\n- The 2015 film Circle was inspired by the 1957 drama 12 Angry Men.\n- Mercy Malick is best known for Mission Control, Major Crimes, Circle, and iZombie.",
